SUMMARY:AFFIRM: Interventional Radiology Educational Day for Women Medical 
 Students
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:Texas Medical Center\, Houston\, TX
DESCRIPTION:One-day event hosted by AFFIRM (Advancing Future Females in Int
 erventional Radiology and Medicine)\, co-founded by PGY-5 IR resident Sydn
 ey Cooper. Includes hands-on procedural workshops with industry partner de
 vices\, short sessions on IR\, radiation considerations and career pathway
 s\, networking with attendings/fellows/residents/program leadership\, and 
 an attending and trainee Q&A.\nHost: AFFIRM (Advancing Future Females in I
 nterventional Radiology and Medicine)\nRSVP requested: https://AFFIRMiniti
 ative.org\nDetails: https://jerrywang123454321-maker.github.io/bcm-events/
 event/58.html
